17:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"CPT stands for Current Procedural Terminology. It is maintained by the American Medical Association, revised annually with changes effective 1 January, and it describes the services and procedures a provider performs. Every CPT code is five characters."}]
